---
description: BazarKav Clean Architecture and folder guards
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow /AGENTS.md, /docs/architecture/ARCHITECTURE.md and /docs/architecture/GUARDS.md.
Separate Commands, Queries and Validation. Keep Domain technology-independent.
Host is composition only. Cross-module dependencies go through Contracts only.
HTTP *Request DTOs belong in Presentation/Requests, one DTO per matching file; never in Contracts or Application. Keep *Command and *Query separate from HTTP DTOs.
Accounting source access is read-only. Preserve business isolation and source identity.
Run the structural architecture guard and appropriate checks for the actual change.
Do not start another implementation task automatically.
